or the Vatly WebhookEndpoint resource.",[554,555,557],"h3",{"id":556},"properties","Properties",[559,560,561,577],"table",{},[562,563,564],"thead",{},[565,566,567,571,574],"tr",{},[568,569,570],"th",{},"Name",[568,572,573],{},"Type",[568,575,576],{},"Description",[578,579,580,599,616,631,645,662,676],"tbody",{},[565,581,582,588,593],{},[583,584,585],"td",{},[502,586,587],{},"id",[583,589,590],{},[502,591,592],{},"string",[583,594,595,596,544],{},"Unique identifier for the endpoint (",[502,597,598],{},"webhook_...",[565,600,601,606,610],{},[583,602,603],{},[502,604,605],{},"resource",[583,607,608],{},[502,609,592],{},[583,611,612,613,505],{},"Resource type, always ",[502,614,615],{},"webhook_endpoint",[565,617,618,623,628],{},[583,619,620],{},[502,621,622],{},"testmode",[583,624,625],{},[502,626,627],{},"bool",[583,629,630],{},"Whether this endpoint receives test-mode events.",[565,632,633,638,642],{},[583,634,635],{},[502,636,637],{},"url",[583,639,640],{},[502,641,592],{},[583,643,644],{},"The HTTPS URL deliveries are POSTed to.",[565,646,647,651,656],{},[583,648,649],{},[502,650,511],{},[583,652,653],{},[502,654,655],{},"string[]",[583,657,658,659,661],{},"The event names this endpoint is subscribed to. An empty array means dormant (no domain events); ",[502,660,525],{}," is still sent.",[565,663,664,669,673],{},[583,665,666],{},[502,667,668],{},"createdAt",[583,670,671],{},[502,672,592],{},[583,674,675],{},"Creation timestamp (ISO 8601).",[565,677,678,683,688],{},[583,679,680],{},[502,681,682],{},"links",[583,684,685],{},[502,686,687],{},"WebhookEndpointLinks",[583,689,690,691,544],{},"HATEOAS links (",[502,692,693],{},"self",[695,696],"hr",{},[546,698,700],{"id":699},"register-a-webhook-endpoint","Register a webhook endpoint",[493,702,703],{},[502,704,705],{},"POST \u002Fv1\u002Fwebhook-endpoints",[493,707,708,709,711,712,505],{},"Register an endpoint for the token's mode. Vatly sends a ",[502,710,525],{},"\nverification ping and validates the URL's SSL certific